===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A person, in a [[church]], [[cinema]] etc., who [[escort]]s people to their [[seat]]s.
# A male [[escort]] at a [[wedding]].
# A [[doorkeeper]] in a [[courtroom]].
# {{context|dated|lang=en}} An [[underteacher]], or [[assistant]] [[master]], in a [[school]].

